- **S3**: Changing `PutBucketEncryption` is instant; **existing objects are NOT re-encrypted** — use S3 Batch Operations to backfill (~$0.25/million objects). `BucketKeyEnabled=true` cuts KMS API costs by up to 99% with no latency trade-off.
- **DynamoDB**: `UpdateTable` triggers online background re-encryption with **zero downtime and no additional cost**. KMS overhead adds <1 ms per operation.
- **SQS**: `SetQueueAttributes` applies only to **new messages**; already-stored messages are not affected. SQS-managed SSE is free; CMK adds ~$1/month per key.
